# Telos, Restoration Zone 0031 (TSL, 231TEL): shot down by Czerka; Bao-Dur
# wakes us and joins (Kreia kept with him, DSimpson's pick), the cannoks
# and Czerka's mercenaries (the escaped criminals among them) and sentry
# droids fought down to the beach and along the cliffs, the minefield's
# turrets, and on to the Czerka site. Starts from the Citadel Station's
# last checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_planet data/routes/tsl/telos_restoration.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Restoration Zone 0031" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
party 1,6            # Bao-Dur joins as we wake in the wreck (the shield
talk                 # network, the old military base); Kreia with him
fight 30             # the cannoks up the way
use G_TURRETBL006@1  # past the mercenaries and the beach to the minefield:
use G_TURRETBL006@2  # its two turrets shot down first (DSimpson)
exit to_233TEL@2     # (the first of the tag is the minefield's warning) down past the mercenaries, the beach and the
module 233tel        # minefield's turrets to the Czerka site
save telos_czerka_site
